{"Title":"An Act providing for the terms of certain bonds to be issued by the Commonwealth","BillNumber":"H4636","DocketNumber":"HD5099","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"GOV7","Name":"Maura T. Healey","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/GOV7","ResponseDate":"2024-05-09T14:19:26.517"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4636/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":"\tNotwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the bonds that the state treasurer may issue pursuant to section 11 of Chapter 89 of the Acts of 2024 shall be issued for a term not to exceed 30 years. All such bonds shall be payable not later than June 30, 2059, as recommended by the governor in a message to the general court dated May 9, 2024 under section 3 of Article LXII of the Amendments to the Constitution.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to provide for the terms of certain bonds to be issued by the Commonwealth, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J32","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J32"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H34","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H4636","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4636/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}